{"title": "Jeweler's Rouge", "pageid": 2113, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Jeweler's Rouge</b> is a substance widely used in Azaron to polish jewels or gems. In the distant past, Pavel after polishing a bracelet he had gotten for <a href=\"/wiki/Deirdre\" title=\"Deirdre\">Deirdre</a>, discovered that this substance was combustable in Yander. Seeing how normal gunpowder does not ignite in Yander, this was a excellent substitute. <a href=\"/wiki/The_Guns_of_Azaron\" title=\"The Guns of Azaron\">The Guns of Azaron</a>, Pavel turns the jeweler's rouge into gunpowder and assembles an army in hopes of taking the throne in Yander.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Jeweler%27s_Rouge?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260429002322\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 356/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.386      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.386      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2113-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260429002322 and revision id 4338. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Art